#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:64
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_ManTryingToDigTunnel"
msgid ""
"My papa told me.\p"
"He says this tunnel is full of\n"
"timid POKéMON.\p"
"They get all scared of loud noise and\n"
"make a big uproar.\p"
"So they had to stop the big tunnel\n"
"project.\p"
"But there's one man. He's trying to dig\n"
"the tunnel by himself!$"
msgstr ""
"这是我爸爸告诉我的。\p"
"他说这条隧道里住着很多\n"
"胆小的宝可梦。\p"
"它们一听到很大的声音就会害怕，\n"
"然后闹得天翻地覆。\p"
"所以挖大隧道的工程\n"
"只好停下来了。\p"
"可是有一个人，\n"
"他想一个人把隧道挖通！$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:75
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_ManDugTunnelForLove"
msgid ""
"There was a man who dug a tunnel for\n"
"a lady he loved.\p"
"I don't really get it, but hey!$"
msgstr ""
"有个男人为了他心爱的女人\n"
"挖了一条隧道。\p"
"我不太懂，不过，挺好的嘛！$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:80
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_AirCleanHere"
msgid ""
"The way the winds blow, volcanic ash\n"
"is never blown in this direction.\p"
"The air is clean and delicious here.\n"
"Living here should do wonders for even\l"
"frail and sickly people.$"
msgstr ""
"因为风向的关系，\n"
"火山灰从来不会吹到这边来。\p"
"这里的空气又清新又好闻。\n"
"就算是身体虚弱、经常生病的人，\l"
"住在这里也会变得健康的。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:87
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_MakeBattleTentDebut"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON and I, we've been riding\n"
"a hot winning streak.\p"
"So I decided to make my BATTLE TENT\n"
"debut in this town.$"
msgstr ""
"我和我的宝可梦\n"
"最近一直连胜。\p"
"所以我决定在这个镇上的\n"
"对战帐篷首次登场。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:93
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_GuyTryingToBustThroughCave"
msgid ""
"Did you see the cave next to the\n"
"POKéMON MART?\p"
"There's a guy in there who's trying to\n"
"bust up boulders so he can bust out\l"
"through to the other side.\p"
"It'd be great if we could go through…\n"
"It'll make it easy to visit RUSTBORO.$"
msgstr ""
"你看到友好商店旁边\n"
"的那个洞窟了吗？\p"
"里面有个人正在打碎岩石，\n"
"想要挖通到另一边去。\p"
"要是能穿过去就好了……\n"
"去卡那兹市就方便多了。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:102
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_EasyToGetToRustboroNow"
msgid ""
"That cave next to the POKéMON MART\n"
"is now a tunnel to the other side.\p"
"It's great--it's easy to go shop for\n"
"new DEVON products in RUSTBORO now.$"
msgstr ""
"友好商店旁边的那个洞窟\n"
"现在变成通往另一边的隧道了。\p"
"真是太好了，现在去卡那兹市\n"
"买得文公司的新产品方便多了。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_TownSign"
msgid ""
"VERDANTURF TOWN\p"
"“The windswept highlands with the\n"
"sweet fragrance of grass.”$"
msgstr ""
"绿荫镇\p"
"“风吹拂的高原，\n"
"飘着青草甜甜的芳香。”$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:113
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_WandasHouse"
msgid "WANDA'S HOUSE$"
msgstr "婉达的家$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_BattleTentSign"
msgid ""
"BATTLE TENT VERDANTURF SITE\n"
"“Feast Your Eyes on Battles!”$"
msgstr ""
"对战帐篷绿荫镇会场\n"
"“尽情观赏精彩的对战吧！”$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown/scripts.inc:120
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Text_RusturfTunnelSign"
msgid ""
"RUSTURF TUNNEL\n"
"“Linking RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF\p"
"“The tunnel project has been\n"
"canceled.”$"
msgstr ""
"卡绿隧道\n"
"“连接卡那兹市与绿荫镇\p"
"“隧道工程已经中止。”$"
